(text "The UART programming fixture uses 3.3 V logic. Connect host TX to fixture RX and host RX to fixture TX." (at 16 127.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid e74aaef3-56dc-51e3-9920-f1077290ecf8))
(text "Drive HOST_BOOT_N low, pulse HOST_EN low for at least 1 ms and release EN. Keep BOOT low 3 ms after EN rises." (at 16 132.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid e9352475-00fa-55a5-ae88-85a8c8bf766a))
(text "Release BOOT and reset after flashing. USB-HS joint-download is also possible on the existing USB-C connector." (at 16 137.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid e24d805c-8b2b-5647-b0b1-6d120a4fdd35))
(text "GPIO60 is held high by R11 on SD_EXT_CS_N. Socket DAT3 is an input in SPI mode. Confirm hot reset with both cards installed." (at 16 142.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 16ae9a18-2164-521c-b02f-82572c3bc182))
